# Goal
string prompt   # assembled prompt / context to reason over
string schema   # optional JSON shape/schema hint the reply must match; empty = free-form text
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage[] images   # optional frames to reason over (empty = text-only); order is meaningful (e.g. before, after)
---
# Result
# Success/failure is the action's terminal status (SUCCEEDED vs ABORTED) — no
# redundant `success` bool. A usable reply SUCCEEDS; a call that could not run
# (empty prompt / timeout / API error / unparseable JSON) ABORTS, with the reason
# in `response`.
string response # the model's reply: canonical JSON when a schema was requested, else raw text; the failure reason on ABORTED
# Stamp of the frame reasoned over (images[-1].header.stamp — the current view),
# mirroring PlanVisualPath. {sec: 0, nanosec: 0} when the call was text-only (no images).
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
---
# Feedback
string state    # "RUNNING" while the API call is in flight
